# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later
# AGPL §13 source offer (§14.1). A self-hoster who modifies vev points this at
# their own fork. There is no PUBLIC_GIT_COMMIT here on purpose: it is computed
# from `git rev-parse --short HEAD` at build time by apps/web/vite.config.ts,
# with a `dev` fallback when git is unavailable (e.g. a tarball build) — one
# source of truth, not a value here that a build could silently disagree with.
PUBLIC_SOURCE_URL=https://github.com/yujiym/vev
